not what you Americans mean by the word tho), but lately I've been losing faith in humanity. I really wanted to see all people happy and out of poverty. I smoke and I don't care how much society tries to paint smokers as the biggest evil on the face of the Earth. I fucking enjoy it. It's the best thing in my life.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/59-stylanski","name":"stylanski","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar59_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"299"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-11T21:25:00-07:00","id":477509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>stylanski</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=474953#post474953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Drunk (on cheap dark rum and diet coke) ST reporting here.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vus8TT0DSww\" data-code=\"Vus8TT0DSww\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/Vus8TT0DSww/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> One fun, weird confession. First time I read Rose Bailey's works, I kinda developed a tiny crush on her. Never seen her, just from what I read.<br /> Please don't ban me, I promise I'm over it and I'm totally not a creep.<br /> <br /> I'm into the occult. I am a Communist (not what you Americans mean by the word tho), but lately I've been losing faith in humanity. I really wanted to see all people happy and out of poverty. I smoke and I don't care how much society tries to paint smokers as the biggest evil on the face of the Earth. I fucking enjoy it. It's the best thing in my life.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I don't know you. I'm a misanthropic, drunk, failed writer with mental health issues.<br /> <br /> That said, I like THE SHIT OUT OF YOU. don't ask why. The whiskey just tells me we should be friends. Trust the booze.<br /> <br /> ***New Friend Acquired***<br /> <br /> 10 Exp.!!!<br /> <br /> P.s. Fuck yeah, Smashing Pumpkins","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-15T23:36:12-07:00","id":482046,"title":"","content":"I have a chronic fear of cover letters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7