"Ok, so I'm a mixed drink away from polishing off a fifth of Smirnoff that I opened two hours ago. I'm drunker than the wraith of Dean Martin....however, from my drunkenness comes reason.<br /> <br /> I need to be straightforward with the girls I'm seeing. Just two, no need to worry. You know the details if you've been in the alley, so I'll be brief.<br /> <br /> I want them both to know that my feelings are serious. I need to see them both, face to face and state my intentions. One girl has kids but is married stilll (technically), and the other wants children. You know the details if you've been in the alley. I've always, at my core, just wanted to make someone happy and someday be a better dad than I had.<br /> <br /> I need to have a serious talk, and find out what THEY want, for real, no flattery.<br /> <br /> I myself KNOW what I want, it's simple: a person that can love me for me and I them, and some kids one day (adoption is cool).<br /> <br /> I just need to know. So far, I've got a pocket full of maybes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 05-25-2015, 06:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-25T05:19:17-07:00","id":527560,"title":