<div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=534046#post534046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ok, so here i am, a bunch of captain cokes into my night. So gonna ask<br /> <br /> Why is it, the more down yoy are, the worse you feel, the less people care? The more likely they are to kick you while down?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Mostly the sad human desire to be better than SOMEONE, whoever they are, in one's mind and the odd confluence of bad circumstances and tragedy that sometimes seem to surround those depressed. It's sad and pathetic in its way, but often true. People, weird as they are, are likely good at the core. Life just sometimes makes us meaner than we would otherwise choose to be.<br /> <br /> I hope that whatever suffering you're experiencing is lessened soon.<br /> <br /> I'm drunk right now. I don't have a reason besides that I had tequila and time.<br /> <br /> I WAS depressed and drunk recently. Very. For both.<br /> <br /> I even drunkenly decided to try ending my life because of it.<br /> Life FORCED me, like an animal, to fight my own suicide. I hated life that day.<br /> <br /> ...I'm really glad life was a pushy asshole and made me stay around.<br /> <br /> The fog, no matter how thick, will roll back.<br /> You're not alone. The things that anchor you might just be a little obfuscated right now.<br /> <br /> Until that fog clears and you can see the sun and sky again, just check in here, alright? Friends here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 05-31-2015, 05:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-04T14:16:57-07:00","id":539968,"title":"","content":"and now, my new anthem<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXgDwGZlua0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXgDwGZlua0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXgDwGZlua0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EXgDwGZlua0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-08T22:11:18-07:00","id":546486,"title":"","content":"flesh banana","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/do