pan style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode\"><span style=\"color:#ee82ee\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b><i><u>Follow me on twitter! <a href=\"https://twitter.com/scelestai\" target=\"_blank\">https://twitter.com/scelestai</a></u></i></b></span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/897-scelesta","name":"Scelesta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar897_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"551"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-15T15:59:48-07:00","id":591967,"title":"","content":"Wednesday, July 15th<br /> <br /> I woke up with that feeling again. That scared, empty feeling. I absconded with my stash of what the locals call &quot;marihuana&quot; and proceeded to smoke it until I felt quite inebriated and strange. I laughed at things that weren't rightly funny. I even accessed my &quot;Twitter&quot; and typed short but pithy missives to a weblike network of people connected via electronic signals of some sort.<br /> <br /> .. afterwards, I felt I had done wrong. Ignored my duties to family, God and country. <br /> <br /> Then I bought a handle of tequila and I was fine. The tequila evened out that TOO HIGH feeling.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm