tually ask them.<br /> Anyway, I'm thinking we finish off by you &quot;leaving me&quot; to &quot;go back to your ex&quot; (aka time to go home. See you online! Great vacate, buddy!). Give a shallow, mean reason why you're &quot;leaving me&quot;, if you can. Play up the sympathy for Me. Might get me some action afterwards. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> You're going home to your girlfriend. I'm single. This is the t.v. version of being a wingman, since you can't act like a real wingman when you're here because we'll be pretending to be engaged.<br /> <br /> If you want to make it less mean, or just a more interesting story, I'll buy your girlfriend a two way ticket and she can show up to &quot;ruin our wedding&quot; instead of you &quot;dumping me&quot;. You two can just fly back together after that. The show would cover YOUR travel. It'd be a fun story to tell your grandchildren.<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200bSee? This entire plan just came to me when I read your post. This is why the universe will never let me meet a genie...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-08T18:01: