ss=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-15T05:24:07-08:00","id":809520,"title":"","content":"I'm already drunk and it's not even the afternoon (a cheese seller who grew up in the same city as me back home offered me free drinks at the farmers' market I go to), so I wrote this little piece. It's meant to be given to my family in case something happens to me, but I wanna share it with someone now and you guys are fun and I like most of you, so here it is.<br /> <br /> <i>I grew up alone and grew old alone. I wandered across cities, countries and continents,<br /> only to make a home out of my loneliness.<br /> <br /> What kept me going is that I finally found a woman that tolerates how much I hate myself,<br /> and I tolerate how much she hates herself.<br /> <br /> I made friends out of the fools I encountered in life,<br /> because who better to keep company to the biggest of them all?<br /> <br /> We drink twice a week, roleplay in our imaginary worlds,<br /> and philosophize about a better world that will never come,<br /> because people are rotten and we, the dreamers, were the most rotten<br /> of the lot.<br /> <br /> Spent my early adulthood trying to hold onto a couple of ideals,<br /> until I grew to resent them and the scars they left on my psyche.<br /> <br /> I wrote stories. Stories where hope emerges victorious, only once<br /> it has transformed itself into hopelessness.<br /> <br /> I witnessed God, I truly, honestly did, in one of my dreams.<br /> It was the purest, strongest experience I ever had.<br /> <br /> So naturally I pushed Her away, until we met again,<br /> once I discovered magick and the occult,<br /> and gambled my mental health,<br /> one ritual and evocation at a time.<br /> <br /> Somehow I survived and realized that nothing matters.<br /> Life, the individual, this is all just a side-effect of consciousness<br /> as we understand it.<br /> <br /> Our lives are there just because the Universe needed one more<br /> variable in the algorithm. If we are the Universe experiencing itself,<br /> or the Universe was created by us, I do not know.<br /> By the time me, or anyone else finds the answer,<br /> it will be too late to do anything with it anyway.<br /> Because behind that door lies either the All, or Nothing and non-existence.<br /> And it won't make a damn difference either way.</i><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fqBVXxINS4U\" data-code=\"fqBVXxINS4U\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/fqBVXxINS4U/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.greece-bynight.com\" target=\"_blank\">Greece By Night LARP</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments