b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thorbes</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=921452#post921452\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm Galician (the most north-western region in Spain, rigth above Portugal) . The beers I mentioned are all from the same brand: Estrella Galicia. They are strong and bitter, with quite a lot of flavour.</div> </div> </div> </div> I will check out those beers then. Thanks for the suggestion.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T08:29:23-07:00","id":921501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Camilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=921248#post921248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm American and the only beers I have had were mostly American brands (Miller, Bud, PBR, Yuengling) although I did drink Sapporo beer once. Wasn't impressed.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh...yea, those are all horrible beers! If you're open to suggestion, I'm sure we could find you some great craft beers. I wasn't never the bigger beer fan, until I finally decided to see if I could find some I liked...and man did I! Theres a whole world of awesome beer out there...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T09:16:30-07:00","id":921518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=921501#post921501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Oh...yea, those are all horrible beers! If you're open to suggestion, I'm sure we could find you some great craft beers. I wasn't never the bigger beer fan, until I finally decided to see if I could find some I liked...and man did I! Theres a whole world of awesome beer out there...</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, try craft beers. Find the local Craft brewery in your area and get a sampler. <br /> <br /> I personally don't drink beer, but I love Cider. I drink angry Orchard crisp apple and a local Honey Cider from East Austin Ciders. If you like wine, you may want to try some of the more dry Ciders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T10:45:33-07:00","id":921558,"title":"","content":"Also on the beer front, while it's nothing to write home about, Samuel Adams has at least been satisfying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T12:04:47-07:00","id":921606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=921518#post921518\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, try craft beers. Find the local Craft brewery in your area and get a sampler.</div> </div> </div> </div>I totally agree! And depending on where you're at, there could be several breweries near you....so check em out.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for my taste, I tend towards darker beers, like stouts, but I do love me some IPA's. Theres a brewery nearish to me that does Belgian style beers that are amazing.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/391092-the-drunk-thread?p=921558#post921558\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also on the beer front, while it's nothing to write home about, Samuel Adams has at least been satisfying.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sam Adams Oktoberfest was the first beer I tried that I really enjoyed. It opened the door to me trying more craft beers(even though Sam Adams itself almost isn't considered craft beer).<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T20:10:16-07:00","id":921826,"title":"","content":"Craft Brew and micro brew are generally what I'd recommend to check out. Hell, there's even a few micro-brews that I like and I'm decidedly NOT a beer drinker. The key phrase I found to look for in a place is &quot;brewpub&quot; as it generally means they do their own beers on site.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind, if you get a sample tray, you're probably going to not care for half of them and outright hate a quarter of them. They cover all styles of brew from the dark stouts to the light wheat beers, with all the flavour options.<br /> <br /> The major brand beers (bud etc) are the beer versions of Coke or Pepsi... they're what you bring to a BBQ as a gift because you know most people will tolerate it even if it's not what they want to be drinking for preference. PBR and the other cheaper beers are the equivalent of store brand colas. You buy 'em when you want a token offering to say you brought SOMETHING that you know no sane person would actually touch.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T21:04:36-07:00","id":921837,"title":"","content"